   "spoken": "And if White tries the bishop check on f7 instead, after the king steps to d8 White is in trouble: the knight hangs, and the queen forks both pieces. Supporting the knight with f4 only lets a pawn chase it away, losing material.",
   "kind": "review",
   "teaches": [
    "why the greedy tries fail"
   ],
   "reanchor": true
