   "line": [],
   "spoken": "For all these reasons we just drop the knight back to f3 — simple, strong, easy to calculate. And if you had the black side, the classy try is the bishop to c5: not trade-or-retreat, but a third option — offer the trade while developing, so you get something in return.",
   "kind": "review",
   "teaches": [
    "trade on your own terms"
